    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Blindly measure brain length-to-width ratios in anti-synapsin images and compare pseudo worms with wild-type reference species. Concordance between external head class and the nearest reference brain distribution supports the claim.";
